 after converting the needle to `unsigned char`; reproduced via `as u8` truncation.\n- **Bugs preserved, not fixed**: `divide_multiplier` ignores its first parameter; `mode_subtract`/`mode_divide`, `is_zero`, and `final_message` are computed but unused; `find_and_replace_char` replaces only the first match. Check order and the exact `>=`/`>` thresholds are unchanged.\n- Arithmetic uses `wrapping_*` to match the compiled C's two's-complement behavior rather than panicking.\n\nOne judgment call worth flagging: I named the crate `translation`, producing `libtranslation.so`, because Cargo cannot emit the C project's hyphenated `libharvest-work-sbQ73V.so` name (hyphens become underscores in lib names). If your harness resolves the `.so` by exact filename rather than globbing `target/release/*.so`, tell me the name it expects and I'll adjust."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":245,"cache_read_input_tokens":34256,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":245,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":5,"service_tier":"standard"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"c612d270-2394-4b2c-8d0a-205f8090ef40","uuid":"ad6f5b5b-fe17-486c-983a-c07d6157a502","timestamp":"2026-08-28T00:47:22.258Z"}
